      },
      {
        "text": "Some opposition voices against the president have not been adequately amplified.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker disagrees with the idea that the president is their boss.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "America’s success relies on the competition of ideas.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The Speaker of the House and the Majority Leader of the Senate have often disagreed with the president.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
